Subject: [PATCH 6.6.y 2/3] ipv6: pass proto by value to ipv6_push_nfrag_opts() and ipv6_push_frag_opts()
Date: Tue,  1 Sep 2026 10:17:57 -0400
Message-ID: <20260901141758.1030958-2-sashal@kernel.org>
X-Mailer: git-send-email 2.53.0
In-Reply-To: <20260901141758.1030958-1-sashal@kernel.org>
References: <2026083115-payer-hate-2a8e@gregkh>
 <20260901141758.1030958-1-sashal@kernel.org>
